<title>JAPAN: Tennex to issue 2.5 bln yen Euroyen CB.</title>
<headline>Tennex to issue 2.5 bln yen Euroyen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Tennex Corp</p>
<p>CO-LEAD MGR - Wako Bank (Switzerland) &amp; IBJ (Switzerland)</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible  ISSUE NO	    AMT   2.5 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON			  ISSU PRICE	  MATURITY 19.Dec.00</p>
<p> CONV PRICE		    CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 06.Jan.97	 CONV TO 05.Dec.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 19.Dec.96   INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE		SUB DATE 10-16 Jul</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI		LAST NIS</p>
<p>The conversion price will be decided on December 3. The company changed its name from Tsuchiya Manufacturing Co Ltd on Oct 1.</p>
</text>
